# ARES V3 policy template
#
# `ares init` writes `ares-policy.toml` by serializing `PolicyEngine::default()` from
# the `ares-policy` crate (valid TOML, round-trips with serde).
#
# To customize: copy the generated `ares-policy.toml` after init and edit the
# `[capabilities."..."]` tables and `[sandbox_boundary]` section. Permission levels
# use snake_case: allow, deny, escalate, sandbox_only.
